          "type": "UInt"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "void*",
      "docs": "Use this type table to cast the specified base ptr to another type\n@note BasePtr must be an instance of the type specified by this type table, or the result is undefined.\n@return BasePtr casted to the type ID specified by ToType, or nullptr if the cast failed"
